<td valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Keeping Home project" "Housing First approach</td>
<td valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Keeping Home uses the Housing First approach to address the needs of homeless, mentally ill substance abusers. Specifically, Keeping Home secures marketâ€rate, scattered site apartments for seriously mentally ill methadone maintenance treatment patients and then uses assertive community treatment to address patients service needs</td>
